  "long_description": "Cloudkick is system to manage cloud servers, such as the Rackspace Cloud and Amazon's EC2.  Cloudkick provides an easy to use monitoring/alerting solution to support your production infrastructure on the cloud.  Cloudkick also gives you a window into your cloud deployment by providing detailed graphs on the health of your servers, and tools to categorize and keep information about what each server is doing.  Cloudkick's mission is to make cloud servers easy to use, where ever the customer needs them.",
